#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:1
msgid "Predictive Charts: Solar and Lunar Returns"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:3
msgid ""
"Return charts mark the moment when a planet returns to the same ecliptic "
"longitude it occupied at birth. Ketu provides two return functions — "
"`solar_return` for the Sun's annual return, and `lunar_return` for the "
"Moon's monthly return."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:5
msgid ""
"Both functions return a full `CHART_DTYPE` structured array (same as "
"`compute_chart`), with the complete natal house system, body positions, "
"and aspect matrix computed for the exact moment of return."
msgstr ""

