msgid ""
"This distinction matters: `solar_return(natal_jd, ..., target_year=2026)`"
" finds the return that falls in the year 2026 (there is exactly one). "
"`lunar_return(natal_jd, ..., target_jd=jd_now)` finds the next lunar "
"return at or after `target_jd` (there are ~13 per year)."
msgstr ""

